      "text": "When a redwood leshy dies, a burst of primal energy explodes from their body, restoring 5d8 Hit Points to each plant creature in a 30-foot emanation. This area is filled with saplings, becoming difficult terrain. If the environment isn't a viable environment for these trees, they wither after 24 hours."
